      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Expand `test_read_temp` to cover the zero/positive sign boundary and `int8_t` domain extremes**\n\nCurrently, `test_read_temp` only asserts a single negative value (`0xff` / `-1 C`) and writes `0x00` back to `LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1` on lines 37–38 without verifying `read_temp` on `0x00`, positive offsets, or the signed 8-bit limits (`INT8_MIN` / `0x80` and `INT8_MAX` / `0x7f`). Testing only a single input point does not verify the sign transition around `0` or the full two\u0027s-complement `int8_t` range `[-128, 127]`.\n\nPlease also assert `read_temp` at `0x80` (`-128 C`), `0x01` (`+1 C`), `0x7f` (`+127 C`), and `0x00` (`0 C`, after the final reset write):\n\n```c\nZTEST(lsm6dsm, test_read_temp)\n{\n\tint temp \u003d 0;\n\n\t/* Negative temperature offset (-1 C from 25 C \u003d 24 C \u003d 297 K) */\n\tzassert_ok(i2c_write8(acc-\u003eport, acc-\u003ei2c_spi_addr_flags,\n\t\t\t      LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1, 0xff));\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eread_temp(acc, \u0026temp));\n\tzassert_equal(temp, C_TO_K(24));\n\n\t/* Minimum int8_t offset (-128 C from 25 C \u003d -103 C \u003d 170 K) */\n\tzassert_ok(i2c_write8(acc-\u003eport, acc-\u003ei2c_spi_addr_flags,\n\t\t\t      LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1, 0x80));\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eread_temp(acc, \u0026temp));\n\tzassert_equal(temp, C_TO_K(-103));\n\n\t/* Positive temperature offset (+1 C from 25 C \u003d 26 C \u003d 299 K) */\n\tzassert_ok(i2c_write8(acc-\u003eport, acc-\u003ei2c_spi_addr_flags,\n\t\t\t      LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1, 0x01));\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eread_temp(acc, \u0026temp));\n\tzassert_equal(temp, C_TO_K(26));\n\n\t/* Maximum int8_t offset (+127 C from 25 C \u003d 152 C \u003d 425 K) */\n\tzassert_ok(i2c_write8(acc-\u003eport, acc-\u003ei2c_spi_addr_flags,\n\t\t\t      LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1, 0x7f));\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eread_temp(acc, \u0026temp));\n\tzassert_equal(temp, C_TO_K(152));\n\n\t/* Zero temperature offset (0 C from 25 C \u003d 25 C \u003d 298 K) */\n\tzassert_ok(i2c_write8(acc-\u003eport, acc-\u003ei2c_spi_addr_flags,\n\t\t\t      LSM6DSM_OUT_TEMP_L_ADDR + 1, 0x00));\n\tzassert_ok(acc-\u003edrv-\u003eread_temp(acc, \u0026temp));\n\tzassert_equal(temp, C_TO_K(25));\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/996124c9-50fa-4d94-8642-3565fdc55671)",
